msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The stables at Castle Ironfist can take you to the Arena, an ancient place where warriors can test their prowess."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:11
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:79
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:112
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:690
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Goblins"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:11
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:112
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Goblins are weak creatures, but they tend to attack in large numbers."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:12
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:113
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Apprentice Mages"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:12
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:113
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though their physical attacks are weak, these mages can cast various elemental attack spells."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:13
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:114
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mordred"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:13
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:114
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A powerful artifact, Mordred is a dagger that possesses the ability to steal the health of its victim and transfer that vitality to its wielder."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:14
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:115
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wizards"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:14
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:115
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Albert Newton in Mist handles the promotion of Sorcerers to Wizards."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:15
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:116
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Abandoned Temple"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:15
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:116
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The abandoned temple northwest of town used to be occupied by the Temple of Baa, but they moved out in a hurry one day last year.  Now there's nothing but snakes, bats, and huge spiders."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:16
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:29
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:54
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:69
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:117
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:409
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:434
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:743
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:911
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Temple of Baa"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:16
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:117
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When the Temple of Baa moved out of that old temple outside of town, all of the little problems we've been having just…went away.  I tell you, there's something unwholesome about those people.  I'm glad they're gone."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:17
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:275
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:118
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:376
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Curses"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:17
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:118
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A wizard friend of mine told me the Temple of Baa was laying curses on our town from the abandoned temple just outside town.  One day they tried to lay the Curse of Endless Vermin on us, only they did something wrong and it backfired, infesting their own temple instead.  They moved righty-o quick once that happened."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:18
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:119
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Treasure"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:18
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:119
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I heard the Temple of Baa abandoned that old temple so quickly they didn't have time to take all their stuff.  It should all still be down there, if you're brave enough to go look for it.  There's a lot of nasty monsters in the way, though, so be careful if you go."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:19
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:120
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's been quite a while since New Sorpigal was raided by goblins, but with goblins living in the very place meant to protect us from them, it can't be too long before we're attacked again, can it? "
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:20
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:121
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Magicians"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:20
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:121
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An evil guild of mages has been searching the southeast end of our peninsula for signs of the fabled Fountain of Magic.  They attack anyone who comes near to scare off potential rivals.  Be very careful if you travel in that direction!"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:21
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:122
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Town Fountains"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:21
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:122
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The three fountains we have here in town are said to draw their water from a spring touched by the gods.  Each one is magical and beneficial to drink from."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:22
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:123
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Goblin Raiders"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:22
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:123
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A raiding party of goblins has staked out the west bridge, hoping to rob and kill travelers.  They aren't very subtle– you can see them from a mile away– but they ARE dangerous.  Watch your step!"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:23
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:124
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "New Sorpigal"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:23
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:124
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our town was founded centuries ago as the last major town in Enroth.  We have historically been a point from which colony ships left for the rest of the world."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:24
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:35
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:125
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:800
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fruit Trees"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:24
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:125
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The fruit on the trees in the orchards of our fair town is quite tasty, and free for all to take.  You should try it sometime!"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:25
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:40
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:126
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:621
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:651
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Islands"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:25
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:126
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Beware of travelling to the islands just off our north shore.  The waters sometime have dangerous monsters, and the islands are none too hospitable, either.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:26
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:127
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Regnan Pirates"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:26
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:127
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's been decades since we were last attacked by pirates from the islands of Regna, and I guess it's about time for us to be attacked again, what with the king missing and all."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:27
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:52
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:128
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:153
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Buccaneers' Lair"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:27
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:52
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:128
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:153
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Buccaneers' Lair in New Sorpigal and Mist can teach you dagger, merchant, identify, perception, and disarm trap."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:28
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:53
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:129
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:154
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Protection Services"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:28
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:129
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You can learn dagger, merchant, identify, perception, and disarm trap at protection services in Silver Cove and White Cap."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:29
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:54
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:130
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:155
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Smugglers' Guild"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:29
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:54
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:130
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:155
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Blackshire and Free Haven are homes to the Smugglers' Guild, where you can learn dagger, merchant, identify, perception, and disarm trap."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:55
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:131
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:156
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Blades' End"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:55
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:131
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:156
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sword, axe, spear, staff, and leather are all taught in Blades' End in both White Cap and New Sorpigal."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:31
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:56
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:132
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:157
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Duelists' Edge"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:31
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:132
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Duelists' Edge in Mist teaches mace, bow, chain, shield, and body building."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:32
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:57
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:133
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:158
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Berserker's Fury"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:32
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:133
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Berserker's Fury in Castle Ironfist can teach you bow, shield, chain, plate, and repair item."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:33
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:113
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:134
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:214
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Silver Helms"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:33
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:134
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Fraternal Order of Silver has recently built a keep just south of Mist.  They used to be such nice people, but now they're so intent on killing evil they destroy anything that isn't perfect, and that's just about everything."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:34
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:64
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:74
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:135
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:685
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:820
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:829
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Taxes"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:34
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:135
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I love living down here!  Lord Newton never remembers to raise taxes."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:35
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:11
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:136
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:545
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bootleg Bay"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:35
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:136
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The islands of Bootleg Bay are home to a few cannibal tribes.  People that visit those islands don't return. "
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:36
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:103
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:137
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:204
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fountain of Magic"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:36
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:137
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Fountain of Magic is supposed to be south of Bootleg Bay, but not many people have ever found it."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:37
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:138
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gharik's Forge"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:37
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:138
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In the islands south of Mist is the forge of Gharik, one of Archibald's fellow mages.  The place is crawling with elementals– no one ever goes there now."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:38
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:116
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:139
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:217
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Castle Alamos"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:38
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:139
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "On an island north of Mist is Castle Alamos, one of the centers of magical study in Enroth.  All sorts of summoning and alchemy occurs in that castle– it's a dangerous place for the casual visitor."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:39
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:140
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Temples"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:39
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:140
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A couple of old temples are said to still stand in the jungle islands of Bootleg Bay.  I wonder if anyone still worships in them?"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:40
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:141
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Water Elementals"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:40
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:141
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Water elementals prowl the waters near Mist.  As if their powerful physical attacks aren't enough, they can also fire Ice Bolts from a distance."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:41
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:142
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Conan"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:41
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:142
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This axe is a hero's dream.  It's enchanted to slay dragons and devils, and does so quite well.  Unfortunately, owners of the axe tend to find such creatures more often then they'd like to."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:42
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:143
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Arch Mages"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:42
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:143
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not many people make it to wizard, and even fewer are promoted to arch mages.  Albert Newton must ask the impossible of those looking to be promoted."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:43
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:144
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mist"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:43
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:144
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mist was originally intended to be a customs and trading port for dealings with the Eastern islands and countries.  Piracy has severely cut into that trade, so we're not as prosperous as we should be."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:44
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:280
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:47
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:65
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:73
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:145
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:381
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:453
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:522
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:889
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Regna"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:44
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:145
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "About 200 miles to the east of us lie the Regnan Islands.  They are inhabited with pirates ruled by an 'emperor' who 'taxes' passing ships that pass near their territory.  The Regnans produce almost nothing on their own, with the exception of weapons and mercenaries."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:45
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:146
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Recipe"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:45
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:146
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear you can make a potion of supreme protection by mixing an orange potion with a green potion."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:46
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:147
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Melody Silver"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:46
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:147
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Melody Silver was recently imprisoned by the Silver Helms in their new outpost south of Mist.  They've been acting awfully strange lately, and it's terrible that they seized such a nice young woman.  Someone's got to do something about those people!"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:47
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:126
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:148
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:227
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Vigilantes"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:47
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:148
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Silver Helms, founded by John Silver, were originally organized to fight brigands and murderers, but they've been harassing citizens for even the most petty crimes recently. "
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:48
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:149
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Trade"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:48
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:149
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most of the international trade on our island is with the Kingdom of Erathia, homeland of our good Queen Catherine.  Erathia is the source of most of our precious metals and stone."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:49
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:150
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Memory"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:49
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:150
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Years of practicing high sorcery can erode the memory of the sorcerer severely, and there is no cure for it.  Even if there was, it's unlikely the victim would remember to use it! "
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:50
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/NPCNews.txt.py:211
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PROFTEXT.txt.py:69
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:151
