#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNews.txt.py:171
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "After Corlagon's defeat in the Succession Wars, he retired to his Estate in the Mire of the Damned to study sorcery.  Rumor has it that he became a lich hoping to survive until Archibald could return."
