msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:429
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2120
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You need to give The Letter to Regent Wilbur Humphrey in Ironfist Castle."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:430
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2121
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would advise that you perform the promotion quests for the six lords of Enroth until you have advanced a little further."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:431
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2122
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Empty sack"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:432
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2123
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must satisfy the six High Council members in Free Haven to visit the Oracle.  Each lord will request a task of you to earn their favor.  Perform each of these tasks and then talk to the Council member of that Lord to gain their approval.  Once all the members of the High Council give their permission, you will be allowed to visit the Oracle."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:433
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2124
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Empty bag"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:434
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2125
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It appears that Slicker Silvertongue is a traitor on the Council.  You will need proof to convince Regent Humphrey and have Slicker removed from the Council.  Go to the Superior Temple of Baa in Kriegspire and return with proof associating Slicker with the Temple of Baa."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:435
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2126
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Oracle has been asleep since Archibald performed his mischief on it.  You will need the four memory crystals to revive the Oracle.  They can be found on Hermit's Isle, in Castle Alamos, in Castle Kriegspire, and in Castle Darkmoor."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:436
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2127
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To gain access to the Control Center, you will need the Control Cube located in the Temple of VARN in Dragonsand.  Bring the Cube back to the Oracle to gain admittance into the Control Center.  The Kreegan reactor is immune to all attacks.  Only the ancient weapons from the Control Center will harm the reactor.  Make sure you have these weapons and the skill to use them."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:437
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2128
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You should probably show The Letter to Andover Potbello in New Sorpigal."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:438
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2129
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Nothing here"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:439
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2130
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Before you destroy the reactor, you will need a spell capable of containing the resulting explosions.  You must free Archibald from his stone prison.  Talk to Nicolai and bring him the Third Eye– he will allow you to use Tanir's Bell to turn Archibald back to normal.  From there, you should be able to convince Archibald to give you the knowledge you need."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:440
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2131
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now you must destroy the Kreegan Hive.  Destroy the reactor, defeat their queen, and make sure to escape with the Ritual of the Void and you will succeed in your task."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:441
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2132
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have no more need of my advice."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:442
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2133
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to my Desert Resort!  You'll notice we don't have the riff-raff associated with the towns and villages of the lands here.  Take a moment to relax and enjoy the serenity of the desert, my friends.  If you're interested, we have a few traders here that will trade rare items for weapons and armor– it may be worth your while to check them out."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:443
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2134
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It seems rumors abound about my little Resort.  Alas, the Fountain of Youth everyone seems to be talking about is not here, it's a few days journey to the west."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:444
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2135
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello!  I've got great suits of armor that I'll trade for golden pyramids or kegs of wine."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:445
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2136
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Empty bucket"
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:446
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2137
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'll trade high quality weapons for golden pyramids or kegs of wine."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:447
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2138
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have a wide variety of magical accessories I'll gladly trade for golden pyramids or kegs of wine."
msgstr ""

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:448
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:2139
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Great to do business with you, here's your armor!"
msgstr ""

