#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:370
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:301
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:301
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1275
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you seek to further your skills with the staff? Excellent! The staff can work offensively and defensively, and make you more difficult to hit. My teachings will raise you to Expert level, but first you must have a skill level of 4 with the staff and of course there is my small fee of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:371
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:302
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:302
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1276
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You wish to continue on the path of mastery of the staff? If you prove an apt pupil and have already achieved an Expert skill level of 7 with the staff, I will gladly instruct you to Master level for 5000 gold.  With the skills I will teach you will have a chance to stun your opponent!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:372
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1277
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To achieve Grand Mastery of the staff, you must deal with me! Before I can instruct you, you must have reached a Master Skill level of 10 with the staff, and pay my price of 8000 gold.  You will learn to fight with the staff and your body, allowing you to utilize the Unarmed skill, if you possess it."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:373
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:304
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:304
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1278
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So the sword is your weapon of choice, and you would like to have the skill to slay more effectively? Then I can help you!  My instruction will teach you to use your blade more quickly than before. If you have 2000 gold and have reached a skill level of 4 with the sword, I will instruct you to Expert level."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:374
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:305
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:305
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1279
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bah!  Even the strongest plate armor can be sliced like a melon by someone who can wield a sword with Mastery!  With an Expert sword level of 7 and 5000 gold this I can teach you!   With the skills I teach, you can carry another weapon in your left hand, making you twice as deadly."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:375
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:306
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:306
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1280
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Even the cheapest steel can save the life of a warrior who has achieved Grand Mastery of the sword. With Grand Mastery you will be more difficult to hit.  If you have reached a Master skill of 10 with the sword and can pay my fee of 8000, I will teach you all the techniques of a Grand Master Swordsman."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:376
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1281
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have a dagger and I bet can kill you before you draw yours! Speed can kill and the dagger is the fastest weapon! With what I can teach you, you can carry another weapon in your off hand. Two are better than one. The Expert skills of the dagger can be yours if you have a dagger skill level of 4 and can pay my modest fee of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:377
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1282
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ha!  The fastest survive! This you learn as a small goblin child!  As a Master of the dagger I have and will survive! My teachings can greatly increase your chance of causing critical damage! If you have an Expert skill level of 7 and 5000 gold I can lead you to Mastery!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:378
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1283
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The quickest dagger, the one that is never seen, is the ultimate weapon.  You can rapidly attack your foe before he has a chance to strike you once.  With Grand Mastery of the dagger, this can be yours.  You must have a Master skill level of 10 and 8000 gold to receive my instruction."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:379
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:310
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:310
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1284
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Speed kills, especially when that speed is driving an axe. With my instruction you can have this Expert ability. You will strike more quickly than before, demolishing your foes! You must first have a skill level of 4 with the axe and pay my price of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:380
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1285
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of the axe and skilled hands can split an opponents head like a pudding. With my instruction you can have this ability! You blows will cause more damage than before, devastating your opponents! But first you must have an Expert skill level of 7 with the axe and pay my price of 5000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:381
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1286
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As a Grand Master of the axe, your opponents' armor will mean nothing.  The effectiveness of their armor will be cut in half as you slice it from their carcass! I can teach you this skill, but you first must have a Master skill level of 10 with the axe and pay me 8000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:382
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1287
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Spear expertise makes you one with your weapon.  With this skill you will cause more damage to your foe.  I can raise you to an Expert level if your skill level is 4 and you have 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:383
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1288
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The spear is your weapon of choice? Would you like to learn to carry a shield or another weapon in your off hand to improve your combat ability?  This knowledge can be yours if you have an Expert skill level of 7 with the spear and 5000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:384
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:315
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:315
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1289
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you seek to further your skills with the spear? Excellent! The spear can work offensively and defensively, and make you more difficult to hit. My teachings will raise you to Grand Master, but first you must have a Master skill level of 10 with the spear and of course there is my small fee of 8000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:385
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:316
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:316
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1290
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Like to keep your enemy beyond arm's reach do you?  The bow is the best way to slay your enemy before he can harm you.  With my teachings you'll reach Expert status and be able to fire your bow more quickly, thus eliminating your enemy at range.  I will teach you if your skill level with the bow is 4 and you pay the price of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:386
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:317
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:317
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1291
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Think you are fast with the bow?  The speed you have now is nothing compared to what I can teach you.  My Master lessons can teach you to fire 2 arrows where Experts can only fire one.  This requires an Expert skill of 7 with the bow and the fee of 5000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:387
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:318
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:318
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1292
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Speed with the bow can definitely be an advantage, but that speed combined with the knowledge of how to seriously injure your foe can be the difference between life and death.  I will teach you Grand Mastery of the bow and you will increase the amount of damage that each shot does.  You must be a Master with a skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold for this instruction."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:388
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:319
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:319
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1293
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The mace is a subtle weapon.  Where blades and dagger slash the flesh, the mace can break bones and destroy organs without all the bloody mess. As an Expert with the mace you will inflict more damage, increasing combat effectiveness.  If you have achieved a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 I will instruct you."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:389
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:320
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:320
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1294
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Who needs subtlety when your opponent is unconscious?  Mastery of the mace will give you the chance to stun or even paralyze your enemy.  For 5000 gold and proof that you have reached an Expert skill level of 7, I will teach you Mastery of the mace."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:390
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1295
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A greater chance to subdue your foe means a smaller chance you will be hurt yourself.  Grand Mastery of the mace will increase your chances of stunning or even paralyzing your foes.  If you have a Master skill level of 10 and can pay me 8000 gold, I will instruct you."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:391
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1296
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Looking to increase your Skill with the Blaster?  If you have a Skill level of 4 in Blaster, I will teach you and you will become an Expert with the Blaster.  With better aim, comes less opponents left standing!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:392
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1297
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Think you know your Blaster?  If you have reached a Skill level of 7 with the Blaster I will teach you how to Master this weapon of destruction.  You miss your target less and less as your Mastery of this weapon improves."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:393
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1298
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your skills improve!  If your Skill with the Blaster is 10, I can teach you Grandmastery of the Blaster.  With this you will hit your target more often than not.  Dealing death and devastation where ever you go!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:394
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1299
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The shield can be your friend.  It keeps those who wish you dead from striking at you.  With the Expert skill in shield that I can teach you, you will eliminate the penalty to your weapon's recovery for carrying a shield.  This skill can be yours for 1000 gold and proof of a skill level of 4 with the shield."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:395
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:326
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:326
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1300
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of the shield makes its defensive bonus doubly effective, making you that much harder to hit!  I will teach you Mastery of the shield if you have reached an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 3000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:396
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:327
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:327
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1301
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Under my Grand Master tutelage, you will learn to make the shield the ultimate defense.  Not only will it protect you in melee but will also give you the benefits of the Shield spell.  This skill can be yours if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 with the shield and pay me 7000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:397
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:328
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:328
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1302
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Leather armor is the lightest protection around.  It keeps those who wish you dead from harming you.  With the Expert skill in leather armor, you will eliminate the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor.  This skill can be yours for 1000 gold and proof of a skill level of 4 in leather."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:398
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:329
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:329
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1303
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of leather armor makes its defensive bonus doubly effective, making you that much harder to hit!  I will teach you Mastery of leather armor if you have reached an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 3000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:399
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:330
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:330
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1304
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Under my Grand Master tutelage, you will learn to make leather armor your ultimate defense.  Not only will it protect you in melee but will also protect you from the elemental spells of Earth, Air, Fire and Water.  This skill can be yours if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 with leather armor and pay me 7000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:400
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:331
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:331
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1305
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Chain armor is more durable than leather and offers more protection.  It keeps those who wish you dead from harming you.  With the Expert skill in chain armor, you will cut the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor in half.  This skill can be yours for 1000 gold and proof of a skill level of 4 in chain."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:401
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:332
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:332
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1306
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of chain armor eliminates the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor.  I will teach you Mastery of chain armor if you have reached an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 3000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:402
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:333
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:333
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1307
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Under my Grand Master tutelage, you will learn to make chain armor your ultimate defense.  Under my instruction you will learn to use chain to take less damage from the physical blows that hit you.  This skill can be yours if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 with chain armor and pay me 7000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:403
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:334
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:334
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1308
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Plate armor is the ultimate protection; compared to it, leather and chain are nothing.  With the Expert skill in plate armor, you will cut the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor in half.  This skill can be yours for 1000 gold and proof of a skill level of 4 in plate."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:404
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:335
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:335
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1309
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of plate armor cuts the amount of damage from physical attacks in half.  I will teach you Mastery of plate armor if you have reached an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 3000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:405
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:336
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:336
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1310
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Grand Mastery of plate armor eliminates the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor.  I will teach you Grand Mastery of plate armor if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 and pay me 7000 gold."
