#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:433
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:373
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:373
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1338
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ever sold an item that turned out to be better than your existing equipment?  Nothing worse than having a merchant snicker at you for not knowing what you're selling. With Expert Identify Item you can attempt to identify weapons and armor to prevent this embarrassment. If your skill level is 4 and you pay 500 gold, I will teach you."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:434
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1339
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wands, scrolls, rings and potions can be important items, and not knowing what they are is just foolishness.  With Mastery of the Identify Items skill you can attempt to identify weapons, armor, and other miscellaneous items.  For a small fee of 2500 gold and demonstration of an Expert Skill level of 7, I can teach you Mastery of the Identify Items Skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:435
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1340
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Found and ancient item or relic and don’t know what it does or what its for.  Ignorance in the case is not bliss, in fact it could very well kill. With Grand Mastery of the Identify Item Skill you can attempt to identify anything you have found including artifacts and relics.  A Master Skill level of 10 and 6000 gold is all that is required to learn this Skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:436
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1341
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.  Want to get better prices for what you buy and sell?  Then you better have the Merchant Skill and fast. I can teach you the Expertise of the Merchant Skill if you have a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 gold.  Expertise doubles your bonus towards prices."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:437
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1342
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.  Want to get better prices for what you buy and sell?  Then you better have the Merchant Skill and learn the ins and outs of trading. I can teach you Mastery of the Merchant Skill if you have an Expert Skill level of 7, a Personality of 50 and pay 5000 gold.  Mastery triples your bonus towards prices."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:438
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1343
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.  Want to get better prices for what you buy and sell?  Then you better have the Merchant Skill and learn the ins and outs of trading. I can teach you Grand Mastery of the Merchant Skill if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold.  Grand Mastery allows you to pay and receive the actual price for goods."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:439
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1344
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.  If you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.  This could be extraordinarily bad. Expertise with the Repair Item skill allows you not only the chance of repairing weapons, but armor as well.  This skill can be yours if you have a Skill level of 4 and pay 500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:440
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1345
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.  If you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.  This could be extraordinarily bad. Mastery of the Repair Item skill allows you not only the chance of repairing weapons and armor any broken miscellaneous item as well.  This skill can be yours if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 and pay 2500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:441
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1346
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.  If you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.  This could be extraordinarily bad. A Grand Master of the Repair Items Skill can fix ANYTHING that is broken.  This skill can be yours if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:442
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1347
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?  There's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby goblin!  Body Building is the only way to go.  You will be stronger and tougher than before!  An Expert of Body Building is tougher than the normal hero.  I can teach you this if your skill level is 4, pay 500 gold and are ready to sweat!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:443
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1348
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?  There's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby troll!  Body Building is the only way to go.  You will be stronger and tougher than before!  A Master of Body Building is much tougher than the average hero.  I can teach you this if your Expert Skill level is 7, pay 2500 gold and have and Endurance of 50! No pain no gain!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:444
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1349
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?  There's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby dragon!  Body Building is the only way to go.  You will be stronger and tougher than before!  A Grand Master of Body Building is the toughest hero you can find.  I can teach you this if your Master Skill level is 9, pay 6000 gold and have and Endurance of 50! No pain no gain!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:445
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1350
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Expert spells?  Meditation is what you need.  With an Expert Skill in Meditation you get a double bonus to your available spell points.  This could mean one more powerful spell when you most need it!  Expertise can be yours if your skill level is 4 and pay me 500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:446
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1351
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Master spells?  Meditation is what you need.  With a Master Skill in Meditation you get a triple bonus to your available spell points.  This could mean one more powerful spell when you most need it!  Mastery can be yours if your Expert Skill level is 7 and pay me 2500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:447
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1352
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Grand Master spells?  Meditation is what you need.  With a Grand Master Skill in Meditation you get a quadruple bonus to your available spell points.  This could mean one or more powerful spells when you most need them!  Grand Mastery can be yours if your Master Skill level is 10 and pay me 6000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:448
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1353
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.   You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.  Perception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Expertise in the Perception skill doubles your chances of finding these hidden things.  For 500 gold and a skill level of 4 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:449
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1354
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.   You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.  Perception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Mastery of the Perception skill triples your chances of finding these hidden things.  For 2500 gold and an Expert skill level of 7 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:450
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1355
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.  You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.  Perception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Grand Mastery of the Perception skill quintuples your chances of finding these hidden things. For 6000 gold and a Master Skill level of 10 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:451
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1356
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"My brother, Elron, was an avid Arcomage player.  Have you played Arcomage yet?  Horribly addicting game, if I do say so.  In any rate, you can only play if you have a deck, and decks are hard to come by… so I guess you probably haven't.  In any case, Elron wanted to go over some strategies to help him win more games.  Unfortunately, he didn't want to be in town because he didn't want anyone else to spy on him learn his tricks so he went to the White Cliff Caves southeast a bit from town.\n"
"\n"
"Elron hasn't been back in almost a week.  I'm certain something horrible has happened to him, but if he's alive I'd like to know that too.  Would you do me the service of locating him?  I don't have a lot of money to pay you back with, but I'd be greatly in your debt."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:452
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1357
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Still no sign of him?  I understand.  If you do happen to find out what happened to him, please let me know."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:453
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1358
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dead?  Oh dear!  Those are certainly his cards, though.  I don't want the cards; you can have them-- that game has cost me enough now.  Oh, poor Elron!  I have a little money you can keep for your help, and thank you for finding out what happened to Elron."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:454
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1359
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The School of Sorcery here in the Bracada Desert collects a number of odd magical paraphernalia.  A few years ago an item of particular interest was stolen from the School by raiders from Deyja.  This item, the Seasons' Stole, was worn by Priests of the Sun during religious ceremonies at the turn of the seasons.  As a representative of the School of Sorcery, I'm authorized to reward you for its return.  Our last information placed the stolen Stole in the Hall of the Pit; I would suggest checking there first."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:455
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1360
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't forget there is a reward for the Seasons' Stole if you are able to find it and return it to me."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:456
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1361
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!  This most certainly is the Seasons' Stole.  Here is your reward; you've done both the School of Sorcery and myself a great service."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:457
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1362
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?  Sick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?  Expert Lock Picking doubles your chance of disarming these traps before they go off.  I will teach you Expert Lock Picking if you have a Skill level of 4 and can pay 500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:458
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1363
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?  Sick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?  Master Lock Picking triples your chance of disarming these traps before they go off.  I will teach you Master Lock Picking if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 and can pay 2500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:459
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1364
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?  Sick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?  Grand Master Lock Picking eliminates these pesky traps entirely before they go off.  I will teach you Grand Master Lock Picking if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and can pay 6000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:460
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1365
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.  Of course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. While your Dodging skill makes you that more difficult to hit, this bonus is doubled when you have learned my Expert teachings.  I will instruct you if you have a Skill level of 4 in Dodging and pay 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:461
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1366
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.  Of course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. While your Dodging skill makes you that more difficult to hit, this bonus is tripled when you have learned Mastery of dodging.  I will instruct you if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 in Dodging and pay 5000 gold"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:462
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1367
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.  Of course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. Or so you thought, for Grand Mastery gives you all of the benefits of Dodging while wearing leather armor. Your Dodging skill makes you that much more difficult to hit and this bonus is still tripled when you have achieved Grand Mastery of Dodging.  I will instruct you if you have a Master Skill level of 10 in Dodging, pay 8000 gold and skill level of 10 in Unarmed combat."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:463
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1368
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hand to hand combat is the quickest way to fight.  No weapons to slow you down. With my Expert teachings you will learn to do more damage with every hit you land upon your enemy. You must have a skill level of 4 in Unarmed combat and pay my price of 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:464
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1369
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You wish to continue upon the path of Mastery of Unarmed combat?  With Mastery you will double your bonus to hit and damage with every attack.  First you must have an Expert skill level of 7 with Unarmed combat and pay 5000 gold.  Only then will I teach you."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:465
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1370
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Attaining Grand Master level of Unarmed combat gives you the chance to avoid attacks entirely, leaving you unhampered to slay your foe.  You must demonstrate a Master skill level of 10 in Unarmed combat, a skill level of 10 in Dodging and pay 8000 gold to receive my instruction."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:466
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1371
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowing what you are up against in combat can mean the difference between life and death.  Being able to identify the monsters and opponents you are fighting can make this difference. I can teach you Expert Identify Monster if you already have a skill level of 4 and and pay 500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:467
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1372
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "He who runs away today lives to run away another day.  This doesn't necessarily mean he is a coward, however.  He may just be very smart.  He may know how his opponent attacks and what spells he may use, if any.  I can teach you Master Identify Monster if you have achieved an Expert Skill level of 7 and can pay 2500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:468
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1373
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you can probe your enemies defenses and know his weaknesses, you will always prevail.  With Grand Mastery of Identify Monster, you will know how your enemy attacks and what his defenses are.  This knowledge will allow you to attack his weakest points. I can raise you to Grand Master of this skill if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:469
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1374
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single weapon is great.  Having knowledge of all weapons is even better.  Armsmaster skill allows you to decrease the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.  I can make you an Expert Armsmaster if you have a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:470
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1375
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single melee weapon is great.  Having knowledge of all melee weapons is even better.  Armsmaster skill allows you to decrease the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.  I can make you a Master Armsmaster if you have an Expert skill level of 7 and pay 5000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:471
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1376
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single melee weapon is great.  Having knowledge of all melee weapons is even better.  Armsmaster skill decreases the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.  I can make you a Grand Master Armsmaster if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:472
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1377
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don’t want to pay for an item from a store?  The five finger discount gives you a chance to to take an item without paying for it.  I can teach you Expert Stealing for 500 gold and if your skill level is already 4.  This will double you chance of success!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:473
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1378
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just a little short on gold?  Or do you think that free is always better than having to pay?  If you already have an Expert Skill level of 7 in Stealing and pay me 2500 gold, I can teach you ways of Master Stealing, tripling you chances of success while stealing!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:474
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1379
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Want to keep all that hard earned gold, do you?  Don’t want to have to pay to replace that broken item you can't repair? As a Grand Master of Stealing I can teach you ways to quintuple your chances of success when stealing.  You must already have a Master skill level of 10 and pay me 6000 gold!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:475
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:412
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:412
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1380
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of the simple potions mixtures?  Want to make something new and potent?  Want to create compound potions?  This knowledge of Expert Alchemy can be yours if you demonstrate a skill level of 4 and pay 500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:476
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:413
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:413
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1381
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Want to know how to use potions and compound potions to make white potions?  I can raise you to Master knowledge of Alchemy if you have an Expert skill level of 7 and pay 2500 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:477
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1382
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The black potion is the Alchemist's ultimate creation!  They can effect so many different things and are even wonderful to taste!  Grand Mastery of Alchemy can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Alchemy, possess one of each of the best reagents and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:478
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1383
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Expert Learning doubles the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.  I will instruct you in Expert Learning if your Skill level is 4 and you pay me 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:479
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1384
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Master Learning triples the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.  I will instruct you in Master Learning if you have an Expert Skill level of 7, pay me 5000 gold and have and Intellect of 50."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:480
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1385
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Grand Master Learning quintuples the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.  I will instruct you in Grand Master Learning if you have a Master Skill level of 10, pay me 8000 gold and have and Intellect of 50."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:481
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1386
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thomas Grey runs the School of Sorcery.  If you're looking for promotion to Wizard or Honorary Wizard, he's your man.  His room is right through the door behind me."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:482
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1387
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Would you like a membership to the School of Sorcery Scroll Shop?  A membership allows you free access to the scrolls available in our library.  It costs 5000 gold for a six month membership, but the shop stocks once per week."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:483
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1388
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here's the membership, remember it only lasts for six months.  Check the shelves in the front rooms here to see what is available."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:484
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1389
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You don't have enough gold-- it's no use trying to fool a Wizard."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:485
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1390
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You want to bury the bones of Zokarr IV in our old barrows?  No dwarf here will brave the dangers, but Zokarr deserves to be laid to rest in the right place.  Look for the secret barrow, the one with only one entrance.  In there is a coffin waiting for Zokarr's bones."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:486
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1391
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We have no one to turn to but you, the new Lords of Harmondale. The Lantern of Light is a treasured holy relic, used by the temples of Erathia.  Its value is more symbolic than of power-- without it the temples servants lose faith.  This Lantern disappeared while being brought to this temple from the temple in Stone City.  We believe it was lost somewhere in the maze-like Barrows.  Please find it and return it to us."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:487
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1392
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you found the Lantern of Light?  We're certain it was lost in the maze of Barrows in the Barrow Downs."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:488
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1393
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you, Lords of Harmondale.  The Lantern's return will bolster our faith and allows us to continue our services.  Please take this small reward as a token of our gratitude."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:489
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1394
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My, brother, Haldar passed away last month.  The family was sending his remains to me to be put to final rest.  Something happened to those delivering these remains to me; they disappeared in Nighon and not been heard from since. I fear my brothers soul will never rest unless they are found!  Please return Haldar to me if you find him? I will reward you well for this!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:490
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1395
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you find Haldar's Remains?  His soul must be in sheer agony!  Please find the jar with his remains!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:491
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1396
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for returning my \"brother's\" remains!  He was a promising Warlock and his life was ended to soon.  Now that I have his remains, I will attempt to bring him back as a Lich, and together we will seek greater power and glory!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:492
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1397
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My lords, I was beset by foul bandits when I returned from Avlee and they took everything I had brought with me from the Elves.  They even took my signet ring!  Without it I cannot continue my business because I cannot seal contracts between myself and other merchants.  I've heard the bandits base themselves out of a camp in Erathia, but I'm no warrior-- I'd not last a minute against them.  Please go to Erathia and see this justice done!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:493
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1398
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You don't have my ring yet?  The bandits are south of Castle Gryphonheart in Erathia.  Please help me, I don't have anyone else to turn to."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:494
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1399
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My ring!  Thank you lords.  I can now continue my business and recover my losses, and you have made the trading routes safer for all the merchants!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:495
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1400
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you are the Lords of Harmondale, eh?  You don’t look like much; we shall see how history judges you!  I myself am a historian and collector of rare historical items.  Lord Markham also collects such items of interest and there is one item in particular that would complete my collection, Parson's Quill-- the Quill used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont ending the first Timber War.  I know you have dealt with Lord Markham before, it's how you became Lords of this land after all, and if you would take this letter to Lord Markham in Tatalia, I'm sure he would respond favorably.  I would be even more in your debt if Lord Markham sends this item back with you!  I would be sure to favorably record your heroic acts and deeds!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:496
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1401
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did Lord Markham refuse to give you the Quill, or have you not even visited him yet?  His Manor is in Tatalia, please don't forget to help me."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:497
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1402
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The actual Peacock feather that was used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont.  My collection is complete!  I will be sure to record your activities and deeds correctly and justly so that all will know you as the true Lords of Harmondale!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:498
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1403
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A letter from Norbert Thrush the Historian? Let me see it.  [Lord Markham scans the letter briefly] Hmmmmm…he wants the Peacock feather that was used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont, does he.  Well, seeing as though he has a supposed original of the Treaty, I guess the feather should go to him.  He has promised me anything else in his collection.  Take this to him and tell him that I will come collect from him shortly!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:499
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1404
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear you folk are the new Lords of Harmondale, eh?  Perhaps you could do me a large favor, and help yourselves in the process.  To the north, in Avlee, lies the Hall under the Hill, the domain of the Faerie King.  He owes me a debt from a previous service of mine, and I would like to collect it.  Unfortunately, the faeries in the Hall and the tricks they play frighten me to death.  If you would deliver this letter to the Faerie King, and return what he gives you to me, I'd be very grateful.  You would also have the chance to meet the Faerie King for yourselves."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:500
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1405
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!  The Pipes!  You don't know what this means to me.  Here, take this as a reward and thank you again for your help in this!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:501
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1406
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't forget to give the letter to the Faerie King.  Without it, he probably won't even want to talk to you."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:502
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1407
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We request your services for only one small task.  In Castle Lambent rests a valuable tapestry taken from an attack on Watchtower 3 years ago.  I would like you to get the tapestry for me, as you must have *some* access to the Castle-- my normal associates can't even come near the place.  I hear a large band of goblins and renegade swordsmen are about... it would be a shame if they happened to find a way to Harmondale.  You have one month to get the tapestry.  Don't be late."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:503
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1408
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We request your services for one task.  A rare and valuable tapestry rests in Castle Gloaming, an antique from near the Silence stolen from the wizards some time ago.  I would like you to get the tapestry for me, as my normal associates don't have access to Castle Gloaming.  In return, I'll make sure that the large band of renegade swordsmen and goblins near Harmondale don't accidentally stumble upon your quiet, little village.  You have one month; don't be late."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:504
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1409
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!  I see that you can be trusted to perform well when called upon.  I'll keep that in mind the next time I need a job done.  Your reward is nothing more than status quo-- things could be much worse than they already are.  Go now, I have no more time for you."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:505
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1410
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see.  Well, it would appear that the band of renegades has indeed discovered your little town, and has begun looting.  You may find your bank account a little, well, pinched.  Consider this a lesson in punctuality.  Go now and have a pleasant, pleasant day."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:506
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1411
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A few years back, while mining underneath Stone City, we came upon quite a shock.  It seems that the Warlocks from Nighon had burrowed under the sea to make a sneak attack upon the shores of Erathia.  Their careless tunneling has sunken the earth around here until now the areas around the old dwarven barrows and, of course, Stone City, rest far above the terrain.  We discovered a force of troglodytes in our mining areas, with a tunnel leading back to Nighon.  If you could help us by ridding the tunnels of the troglodytes, we could get back to mining.  Can you help us?"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:507
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1412
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are still troglodytes roaming the lower mine levels.  Please remove them!"
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:508
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1413
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "They're gone?  Routed back into the connecting tunnels to Nighon!  Excellent!  We can get back to mining immediately!  Thank you so much for your help; take this as a reward for your services."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:509
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1414
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have recently gained information that the forces of Queen Catherine, in Erathia, have begun to build a force to attack Deyja.  Because of the difficult terrain, they have begun to breed and train griffins to assist in their attack.  These griffins are being raised in both Erathia and the Bracada Desert.  I need you to kill off all the griffins in those two areas so that the Erathians will be forced to drastically delay their plans of attack."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:510
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1415
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You haven't killed off all the griffins in either Erathia or the Bracada Desert.  It is imperative that you finish this task to prevent their invasion."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:511
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1416
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You've killed the griffins near Spyre Town, but you haven't dealt with the griffins in Erathia yet.  Finish them both off and return to me."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:512
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1417
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You've killed the griffins near Steadwick, but you haven't dealt with the griffins in the Bracada Desert yet.  Finish them both off and return to me."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:513
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1418
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!  You've done a splendid job.  Here, take this as your reward and know you've earned the respect of Deyja for your bold success."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:514
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1419
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Baby Dragon grants all Warlocks in the party a bonus of 3 to all their spell skills and recovers spell points for them over time.  The Dragon, however, needs food to grow up big and strong and therefore resting requires an additional food."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:515
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1420
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master instructor of the Staff, Elsie Pederton, can be found in the Bracada Desert, on a ridge in the southwest region."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:516
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1421
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The ultimate teacher in the ways of the Staff, Jillian Mithrit, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.  Her home is in the city in the northeast."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:517
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1422
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master instructor of the Sword, Tugor Slicer, maintains his residence in a small village in the western region of the Deyja."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:518
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1423
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Sword, Chadric Townsaver, can be found in a small village in Welnin, just south of the city of Harmondale."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:519
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1424
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master tutor of the Dagger, Aznog Slasher, can be found in the northern region of Nighon."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:520
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1425
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Dagger, Token Fist, can be found in city of Tidewater in Tatalia.  Rumor has it that the Master Thief in the depths of the Erathian Sewers beneath the capitol city of Steadwick can also instruct at this level."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:521
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1426
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master Instructor of all that is the Axe, Dalin Keenedge, can be found in the northeast corner of Stone City."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:522
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1427
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The ultimate teacher of the uses of the Axe, Karn Stonecleaver, can be found in the snowy heights of the northeast region of Tatalia."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:523
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1428
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master teacher, Claderin Silverpoint, can be found in the northeast section of the city of Pierpont in the elven region of the Tularean Forest. There he will further you knowledge of the Spear."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:524
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1429
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Spear, Selene Falconeye, makes her home in the northeast corner of Stone City."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:525
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1430
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master tutor of the Bow, Lanshee Ravensight, lives in the northern regions of Nighon."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:526
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1431
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Bow, Cardric the Steady, can be found just to the southeast of the castle in the city of Harmondale."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:527
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1432
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master instructor of the Mace, Brother Rothham, can be found in the southern region of the swamps of Tatalia."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:528
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1433
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Mace, Patwin Felburn, teaches from his home in the goblin village found in the eastern area of the Deyja. "
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:529
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1434
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My Master, Isram Gallowswell, can be found in the snowy heights of the northeast area of Tatalia. You will gain further instruction in the Shield there."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:530
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1435
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Shield, Fedwin Smithson, can be found on the eastern island of the Evenmorn Islands."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:531
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1436
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master tutor of Leather Armor, Rabisa Neldon, lives in the northern regions of Nighon."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:532
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1437
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of Leather Armor, Miyon the Quick, can be found in the eastern section of the city of Pierpont in the elven region of the Tularean Forest."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:533
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1438
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master instructor of uses of Chain Armor, Medwari Dragontracker, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.  His home is in the city in the northeast."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:534
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1439
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster instructor of Chain Armor, Halian Nevermore, maintains his residence in a large city in the northwest region of Deyja."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:535
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1440
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My Master, Dekian Forgewright, makes his home in Erathia in the capitol city of Steadwick. He can provide further instruction in the uses of Plate Armor."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:536
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1441
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of Plate Armor, Brand the Maker, can be found in the Bracada desert, on a ridge in the central region."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:537
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1442
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master tutor of Fire Magic, Ashen Temper, can be found in the city of Harmondale near the stables."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:538
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1443
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of Fire Magic, Blayze, makes his home in Erathia in the capitol city of Steadwick."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:539
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCText.txt.py:1444
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master tutor of Air Magic, Rislyn Greenstorm, lives in the elven territory of Avlee.  His home is in the city in the northeast."
