msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shared Life combines the life force of your characters and redistributes it amongst them as evenly as possible.  All current hit points are totaled and 3 extra points per point of skill in Spirit Magic is added to this total.  Then the points are distributed back to the characters, with no individual character being allowed to have more points than his maximum total hit points."
msgstr ""

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:60
