#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:2
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:2
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Staves are blunt two-handed pole weapons effective on both offense and defense. At expert rank, skill increases your armor class. Masters have a chance of stunning their opponents, and grandmasters gain a bonus to their attack damage."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:3
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:3
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "The sword skill covers most types of blades longer than a knife.  Expert swordsmen gain quicker attacks. Masters may use any one-handed sword in their left hand and another weapon in their right."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:5
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:5
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "While slow on the attack, axes do a lot of damage when they hit.  Expert axe fighters gain a little more speed on their attacks while master axe fighters can deliver extra damage."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:6
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:6
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "The spear skill allows use of bladed pole weapons. Expert spearmen strike for greater damage, and masters can wield spears in one hand."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:8
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:8
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Mace skill covers all kinds of blunt trauma weapons ranging from large clubs to flails.  Expert mace swingers do extra damage with their weapons. Masters and grandmasters can stun or paralyze their opponents."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:9
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:9
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "A weapon from before the Silence, their making has long since been lost.  Expert and master blasters gain double and triple accuracy with these awesome weapons."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:10
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:10
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Shield skill directly improves a character’s armor class while a shield is employed.  Expert and master rankings in the shield increase this defensive bonus."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:11
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:11
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Leather armor is the lightest armor a character can wear.  While leather provides less protection than chain or plate armor, it also slows your character down the least.  Leather armor skill increases the protection offered by leather armor. "
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:12
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:12
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Chain armor is the medium armor type.  It provides more protection than leather and less than plate, but it also slows your character down more than leather.  Chain armor skill increases the protection offered by chain armor.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:13
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:13
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Plate armor is the heaviest armor type.  It provides the most protection, but it slows your character down more than leather or chain.  Plate armor skill increases the protection offered by plate armor."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:14
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:14
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Fire"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:14
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:14
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "All fire magic spells are all combat-oriented and include some of the strongest direct damage spells. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:15
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:15
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Air"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:15
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:15
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Air magic has a mixture of combat, informational and maneuvering spells, including the very useful, Fly. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:16
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:16
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Water"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:16
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:16
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "While it does have some combat spells, water magic is more loaded with travel and item spells. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:17
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:17
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Earth"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:17
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:17
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Earth magic has a balanced mix of offensive and defensive spells, and includes some healing and adventuring magic.  At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:18
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:18
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Spirit"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:18
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:18
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Spirit magic concentrates on spells involving life and death.  Included are spells to raise the dead, which affect the undead, and which increase combat effectiveness.  At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:19
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:19
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Mind"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:19
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:19
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Mind magic spells directly affect the minds of their targets. They can heal or cause mental states, and cause direct damage. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:20
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:20
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Body"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:20
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:20
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "While body magic includes some direct damage spells, it is the magic most concerned with healing. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:21
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:21
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Light"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:21
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:21
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Light magic includes some of the most powerful offensive an protective spells, but is only usable by clerics. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:22
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:22
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Dark"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:22
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:22
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Only usable by necromancers, dark magic has the most spectacular damaging and creature controlling spells available. At higher ranks you can learn more powerful spells and cast the ones you know with greater effect."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:23
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:23
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Dark Elves are born with abilities not shared by other races. Like the racial abilities of Vampires and Dragons, Dark Elven abilities are cast like spells, but are acquired like skills. Dark Elves start out able to cast Glamour, then gain Travelers' Boon, Blind, and Darkfire Bolt as they gain expert, master and grandmaster ranking."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:23
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:23
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Can cast Glamour which increases caster's appeal to others."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:23
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:23
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Can cast Travelers' Boon which has effects of Torchlight, Wizard Eye and Feather Fall."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:23
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:23
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Can cast Blind. Targets of the spell wander aimlessly and cannot use spells or missiles."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:23
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:23
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Can cast Darkfire, a magic bolt which does Dark and Fire damage."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:24
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:24
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Vampires are innately powerful creatures with special abilities. Like the racial abilities of Dragons and Dark Elves, Vampire abilities are cast like spells, but are acquired like skills. All Vampires can cast Lifedrain, and gain Levitate, Charm and Mistform at expert, master and grandmaster rankings."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:24
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:24
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Can cast Lifedrain which harms its target and heals the caster."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:24
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:24
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Can cast Levitate to move party over harmful surfaces taking no damage."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:24
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:24
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Can cast the Charm spell on nearby targets."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:24
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:24
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Can assume Mistform. In mistform a vampire cannot take or deal physical damage."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:25
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:25
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Dragons are powerful creatures with innate abilities. Like the racial abilities of Dark Elves and Vampires, Dragon abilities are cast like spells, but are acquired like skills. Dragons begin able to cast Fear, then gain a second breath weapon, Flight, and Wing Buffet at expert, master and grandmaster rankings. Skill in Dragon ability increases both Armor Class and breath weapon damage."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:25
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:25
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Can cast Fear which causes its targets to flee."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:25
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:25
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Gains Breath Weapon which launches an exploding fireball."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:25
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:25
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Gains Flight which allows dragon to carry party through the air."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:25
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:25
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Gains Wing Buffet which pushes back opponents."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:26
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:26
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "The identify item skill is automatically applied when you right-click on an unidentified inventory item. If your character's skill is high enough, the item becomes identified."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:28
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:28
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Repair"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:28
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:28
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "The repair skill allows your characters to repair broken equipment. Higher skill levels allow them to repair better items. The skill is automatically applied when you right-click on a broken item in your inventory."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:29
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:29
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Bodybuilding"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:29
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:29
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Bodybuilding skill adds hit points directly to your characters' hit point totals. Hit points gained are equal to a character's Base Hit Points/Level time skill. Expert ranking doubles this total and master triples it."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:30
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:30
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Meditation skill adds spell points directly to your characters' spell point totals.  Spell points gained are equal to a character's Base Spell Points/Level times skill. Expert ranking doubles this total and master triples it."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:31
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:31
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "The perception skill gives your characters a chance to notice hidden doors and traps, and to avoid damage from traps when they are triggered. At expert and master levels, your characters will notice more. Grandmasters will see all hidden objects."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:32
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:32
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Characters with the regeneration skill will slowly regain lost hit points over time. Higher skill levels increase how quickly damage is healed."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:32
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:32
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Increases hit points regained over time"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:32
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:32
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Larger increase to hit points regained over time"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:32
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:32
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Largest increase of hit points regained over time"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:33
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:33
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Disarm Traps"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:33
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:33
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "The disarm traps skill is checked automatically when you open a trapped chest or other container.  A higher skill in disarm traps gives a better chance of disarming the trap.  Experts and masters enjoy an increased chance of disarming traps, while grandmasters always succeed."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:36
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:36
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "The identify monster skill is applied when you right-click on a monster. At basic level, the skill allows you to see a monster's hit points and armor class. At higher expertise levels, more information is displayed."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:37
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:37
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Armsmaster skill represents the warrior's tricks of the trade.  Initially, armsmaster reduces the recovery times of your melee weapons. At higher expertise levels it gives you a bonus to hit then to damage."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:39
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:39
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "The alchemy skill allows you to mix potions.  Without the alchemy skill, you barely have the knowledge to make a simple potion, though alchemy skill is added to the strength value of the base ingredient to determine the strength of a simple potion. Higher rankings allow you to mix more complicated potions."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:40
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:40
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "The learning skill directly increases the experience a character receives.  Every point of skill is a percent of awarded experience that is given as a bonus (plus a starting bonus of 9%).  Five skill points would turn a 100 experience point award into a 114 experience point award.  Expert doubles and master triples this bonus, so 10 points of learning at master rank would give a 39% bonus to all experience point gain."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:3
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:3
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Torch Light increases the radius of light surrounding your party in the dark.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:4
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:4
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Launches a burst of fire at a single target.  Damage is 1-3 points of damage per point of skill in Fire Magic.   Firebolt is safe, effective and has a low casting cost."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:5
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:5
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to fire damage by an amount equal to your skill in Fire Magic. The effect lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:6
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:6
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Causes a weapon that has no special abilities to burn with a magical fire, giving the weapon the \"of Fire\" ability.  This spell lasts for one hour per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:6
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:6
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Grants \"of Fire\""
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:6
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:6
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Grants \"of Flame\""
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:6
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:6
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Grants \"of Infernos\""
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:6
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:6
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Grants \"of Infernos\" permanently"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:7
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:7
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Reduces the time it takes for all of your characters to recover from casting spells or attacking with their weapons.  When the spell wears off, they become weak.."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:8
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:8
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a ball of fire at a single target. When it hits, the ball explodes damaging all those nearby, including your characters if they're too close.  Fireball does 1-6 points of damage per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:11
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:11
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons flaming rocks from the sky which fall in a large radius surrounding your chosen target.  Try not to be near the victim when you use this spell.  A single meteor does 8 points of damage plus 1 per point of skill in Fire Magic.  This spell only works outdoors."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:12
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:12
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Inferno burns all monsters in sight when cast, excluding your characters.  One or two castings can clear out a room of weak or moderately powerful creatures. Each monster takes 12 points of damage plus 2 per point of skill in Fire Magic.  This spell only works indoors."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:13
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:13
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Among the strongest direct damage spells available, Incinerate inflicts massive damage on a single target.  Only the strongest of monsters can expect to survive this spell.  Damage is 15 points plus 1-15 per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:15
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:15
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Wizard Eye causes the automap located in the lower right corner of the adventure screen to show the locations of monsters and other points of interest while outdoors.  The spell lasts 1 hour per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:15
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:15
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shows other points of interest"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:16
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:16
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Feather Fall prevents your characters from being hurt when falling more than ten feet by slowing the speed of their fall.  Feather Fall affects your entire party with one casting and has a duration based on your skill in Air Magic. "
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:17
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:17
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to air damage by an amount equal to your skill in Air. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:18
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Sparks fires small balls of lightning into the world that bounce around until they hit something or dissipate. It is hard to tell where they will go, so this spell is best used in a room crowded with small monsters. Each spark does 2 points plus 1 per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:19
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:19
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Jump launches your party 60 feet into the air, allowing you to reach high ledges and jump large crevasses.  Your party takes no falling damage from the jump."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:21
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:21
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Lightning Bolt discharges electricity from the caster’s hand to a single target.  It always hits and does 1-8 points of damage per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:22
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:22
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Invisibility works on the minds of nearby creatures, making them unable to notice the party unless spoken to or attacked.  Any attack you make, regardless of whether or not it hits or misses, will break this spell. This spell can't be cast while hostile monsters are nearby."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:24
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:24
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Grants the power of flight to your characters!  This spell is very expensive and only works outdoors, but it is very useful.  Fly will drain one spell point every five minutes it is in use (i.e. when you aren't touching the ground)."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:25
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:25
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Calls stars from the heavens to smite and burn your enemies.  Twenty stars are called, and the damage for each star is 20 points plus 1 per point of skill in Air Magic. Try not to get caught in the blast! This spell only works outdoors."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:28
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:28
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Sprays poison at monsters directly in front of your characters.  Damage is low, but few monsters have resistance to Water Magic, so it usually works.  Each shot does 2 points of damage plus 1-2 per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:29
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:29
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to water damage by an amount equal to your skill in Water Magic. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:30
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:30
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a bolt of ice at a single target.  The missile does 1-4 points of damage per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:31
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:31
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Only useful outdoors, Water Walk lets your characters walk along the surface of water without sinking.  In addition to its casting cost, one spell point is expended every 20 minutes while your party is in contact with water."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:32
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Item loses 50% - 1 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:32
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Item loses 30% - 1 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:32
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Item loses 20% - 1 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:34
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "When cast, this spell has a chance of imbuing a normal item with magical powers.  The chance of success is 10% per point of skill in Water Magic.  Grandmasters can manage better enchantments."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:35
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:35
#, python-format
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Town Portal teleports the party to any town where the party has drunk from the central fountain.  Town Portal has a 10% chance per point of Water Magic skill of working when cast, and cannot be used while hostile monsters are nearby.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:36
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a ball of ice in the direction the caster is facing.  The ball will shatter when it hits something, launching 7 shards of ice in all directions except the caster’s.  The shards will ricochet until they strike a creature or melt.  Each shard does 12 points of damage plus 1-6 per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:37
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:37
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Lloyd’s Beacon lets you place a marker at a location you want to teleport back to in the future.  Just how far in the future depends on your skill in Water Magic.  Cast this spell whenever you wish to either place a marker or return to one.  Each beacon will decay after 1 week per point of skill in Water magic after it is placed."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:41
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:41
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all of your characters’ resistance to Earth Magic damage by an amount equal to your skill in Earth. The effect lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:42
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:42
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons a swarm of biting, stinging insects to bedevil a single target.  The swarm does 5 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:43
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:43
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all of your characters' armor class by 5 + 1 point per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:45
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:45
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Removes the stoned condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Earth Magic the longer the condition can have been present before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:46
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:46
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Releases a magical stone into the world that will explode when it comes into contact with a creature or enough time passes.  The rock will bounce and roll until it finds a resting spot, so be careful not to be caught in the blast.  The explosion causes 10 points of damage plus 1-10 points of damage per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Launches a magical stone which bursts in air, sending shards of explosive earth raining to the ground.  The damage is 20 points plus 2 per point of skill in Earth Magic for each shard.  This spell can only be used outdoors."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:51
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Allows the party to see an opponent's current health as an exact hit point number when you right-click on a creature."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:55
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Removes the cursed condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer the condition can have been present before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:56
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Preservation more tightly binds the soul to the body. This will delay death due to massive hit point loss, but will not stop a character from going unconscious. If a preserved character's hit points are too low when the spell wears off, he or she will die."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:57
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Heroism increases the damage a character does on a successful attack by 5 + 1 point per point of skill in Spirit Magic. This spell affects the entire party at once."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:58
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:58
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This spell weakens the link between a target's body and soul, causing 10 + 2-8 points of damage per point of skill in Spirit Magic to all monsters near the caster."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:59
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:59
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Raises a character from the dead if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer a character can have been dead before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to raise the character short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple.  Casting this spell will leave your character in the weak condition."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shared Life combines the life force of your characters and redistributes it amongst them as evenly as possible.  All current hit points are totaled and 3 extra points per point of skill in Spirit Magic is added to this total. Then the points are distributed back to the characters, with no individual character being allowed to have more points than his maximum total hit points."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:61
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Resurrects a character whose body has been destroyed.  Recovery rate is very slow, but will be faster for characters with a higher skill in Spirit Magic.  The resurrected character will be in a weak condition after this spell is cast."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:64
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Removes the afraid condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Mind Magic the longer the condition can have been present before the spell no longer is effective.  After that, the condition may only be removed by resting or at a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:65
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to Mind Magic damage by an amount equal to your skill in Mind Magic. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:66
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:66
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a bolt of mental force which damages a single target's nervous system.  Mind Blast does 3 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures paralysis if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Mind Magic the longer the character can have been paralyzed before the \"point of no return\" is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:70
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:70
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "All creatures in the caster’s sight fear the caster and flee.  If a creature takes damage while under the influence of this spell, the spell will be broken. The duration of Mass Fear is 3 minutes per point of skill in Mind Magic.  Mass Fear will not work on undead creatures. "
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:71
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:71
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures insanity if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Mind Magic the longer the character can have been insane before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:72
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:72
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Similar to Mind Blast, Psychic Shock targets a single creature with mind damaging magic--only it has a much greater effect.  Psychic Shock does 12 points of damage plus 1-12 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:73
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:73
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Takes control of target's mind for 10 minutes per point of skill in Mind Magic.  Enslaved creatures will fight monsters that are hostile to the caster for the duration of the spell, and will not fight with the caster even if attacked by the caster or his friends.  This spell will not work on the undead."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:75
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures the weak condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Body Magic the longer the character can have been weak before the spell will no longer work.  After that, the condition may be removed by resting or at a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures hit points on a single target when cast.  The number cured is equal to 5 plus 2 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 5 hit points plus 3 per point of skill and can be cast on distant targets"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:77
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:77
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to Body Magic damage by an amount equal to your skill in Body Magic. The protection lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:79
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster hit point recovery rate"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:79
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest hit point recovery rate"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:80
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:80
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures poison in a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Body Magic the longer the character can have been poisoned before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:81
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Hammerhands magically enhances the skill of an unarmed combatant, allowing his strikes to land more precisely against an opponent's weak spots.  Hammerhands-aided attacks inflict extra Body damage equal to the physical damage caused by the unarmed attack."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:82
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:82
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures disease in a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Body Magic the longer the character can have been diseased before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:84
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:84
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Flying Fist throws a heavy magical force at a single opponent that does 20 points of damage plus 1-10 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:88
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:88
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Calls upon the power of heaven to undo the evil magic that extends the lives of the undead, inflicting 16 points of damage plus 1-16 per point of skill in Light Magic upon a single, unlucky target.  This spell only works on the undead."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:89
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Removes all spells on all creatures in the caster’s sight, both helpful and harmful.  Recovery is reduced by an amount equal to skill in Light Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:90
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:90
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Paralyze temporarily prevents a monster from moving or attacking for the duration of this spell, which is 3 minutes per point of skill in Light Magic.  You are free to attack your helpless target to your heart's content--paralyzed monsters cannot retaliate."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons a Dancing Light to fight for the party.  It will stay until the spell duration runs out or it is destroyed.  You can have no more than 1 elemental summoned at once."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 5 minutes per point of skill.  1 Dancing Light maximum."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons a Wisp.  Duration 15 minutes per point of skill. 3 Wisps maximum."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons a Will O' Wisp.  5 Will O' Wisps maximum."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:92
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Temporarily increases all seven stats on all your characters by three times your skill in Light Magic.  This spell lasts until you rest."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:96
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:96
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Sunray is the second most devastating damage spell in the game. It does 20 points of damage plus 1-20 points per point of skill in Light Magic, by concentrating the light of the sun on one unfortunate creature. It only works outdoors during the day."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:97
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:97
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Three times per day you may call upon the heavens to heal your characters of all damage, restore your spell points and remove all adverse conditions.  The gods exact a price, however, aging the caster 10 years for each Divine Intervention.  Recovery from this spell is shortened with skill in Light Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:99
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Reanimate allows you to raise a lifeless creature from the dead (sort of).  The zombie will fight against monsters hostile to the caster until it is killed (again) or until the party leaves the map.  The zombie will have 10 hit points per point of skill in dark magic, up to its normal maximum. This spell cannot be cast on party members."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:101
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:101
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Enchants a weapon with the Vampiric ability.  Damage inflicted on monsters struck by this weapon will be given to the weapon's wielder as extra hit points, up to his or her normal hit point maximum."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:102
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:102
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shrinks even the grandest of monsters down to more manageable sizes. Duration of this spell is 5 minutes per point of skill in Dark Magic. Depending on the caster's expertise, a shrunken monster deals one half, one third, or one quarter its normal damage while shrunk."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:102
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:102
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Will affect other monsters near the target"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:103
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:103
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a blast of hot, jagged metal in front of the caster, striking any creature that gets in the way.  Each piece inflicts 1-6 points of damage per point of skill in Dark Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:104
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Takes control of an undead target's mind for 3 minutes per point of skill in Dark Magic.  Controlled undead will fight monsters that are hostile to the caster for the duration of the spell, and will not fight with the caster even if attacked by the caster or his friends."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:105
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "When a monster hits a character with Pain Reflection active, the monster takes damage equal to what it inflicted on the character."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:106
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This spell surrounds its target with the power of raw darkness, rendering it unable to fire missile attacks or cast spells. Further the target's movement is slowed, its armor class is halved and it does half damage when striking in melee combat."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:107
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:107
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Dragon Breath empowers the caster to exhale a cloud of toxic vapors that targets a single monster and damage all creatures nearby, doing 1-25 points of damage per point of skill in Dark Magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:108
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:108
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This spell is the town killer. Armageddon inflicts 50 points of damage plus 1 point of damage for every point of Dark skill your character has to every creature on the map, including all your characters. It can only be cast three times per day and only outdoors.  "
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:111
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:111
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This ability grants a more appealing manner and appearance to whomever the Dark Elf deals with.  The net effect is a bonus to Merchant skill for the duration of the ability's effect."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:111
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:111
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 5 minutes per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:111
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:111
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Larger bonus to Merchant skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:112
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:112
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Travelers' Boon"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:112
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:112
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Travel Boon"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:112
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:112
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This ability simultaneously casts Torchlight, Wizard Eye, and Feather Fall at Expert level of mastery."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:112
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:112
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 2 hours per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:113
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:113
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This ability strikes its target blind. Affected creatures cannot perform missile attacks or cast spells, and wander aimlessly until the effect wears off."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:114
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:114
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Darkfire Bolt"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:114
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:114
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Darkfire"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:114
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:114
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This frightening ability grants the Dark Elf the power to wield Darkfire, a dangerous combination of the powers of Dark and Fire. Any target stricken by the Darkfire bolt resists with either its Fire or Dark resistance--whichever is lower. Damage is 1-17 per point of skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:123
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:123
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Lifedrain"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:123
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:123
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Lifedrain allows the vampire to damage his or her target and simultaneously heal based on the damage done in the Lifedrain.  This ability does 3 points of damage plus 1-3 points of damage per skill."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:123
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:123
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Vampire heals 1/3 the damage done by Lifedrain"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:123
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:123
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Damage 5 points plus 1-5 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:123
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:123
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Damage 7 points plus 1-7 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:124
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:124
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Levitate"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:124
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:124
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This ability allows the vampire to levitate the party slightly off the ground, avoiding damage from drowning or lava, and also avoiding setting off ground traps."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:124
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:124
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 3 hours per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:125
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:125
msgctxt "spells vampire"
msgid "Charm"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:125
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:125
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "A vampire using this ability can charm a small group of targets in close proximity."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:125
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:125
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration permanent"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:126
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:126
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Mistform"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:126
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:126
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Mistform allows the vampire to render himself immune to physical damage.  However, a vampire in Mistform cannot perform any physical attacks.  Vampires in Mistform are able to use spells and abilities and are affected by spells and abilities."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fear"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This ability allows the Dragon to strike fear in its opponents' thoughts. If the target doesn't resist the effects, it will flee in panic for the duration of the effect."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 5 minutes plus 1 per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Affects target and all creatures within immediate vicinity"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Affects all creatures within view"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:136
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:136
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Flame Blast"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:136
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:136
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This ability is an upgraded version of the normal Dragon breath weapon attack.  It acts much like a fireball, striking its target and exploding out to hit everything near it, except the explosion does much more damage than most fireballs."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:136
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:136
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Damage 10 points plus 1-10 points per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:136
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:136
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Damage 11 points plus 1-11 points per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:136
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:136
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Damage 12 points plus 1-12 points per point of skill"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:137
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:137
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Flight"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:137
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:137
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Allows the Dragon to carry the party in flight.  This ability is expensive and only works outdoors, but it is very useful.  Flight will drain one spell point every five minutes it is in use (i.e. when you aren't touching the ground)."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:138
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:138
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Wing Buffet"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:138
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:138
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Buffet"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:138
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:138
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This ability allows a Dragon to push back opponents with wing generated wind--great for pushing them back before hitting them with a Flame Blast."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:2
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:46
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Necromancers are magicians who have succumbed to the temptations of the Dark Path. They are the class best at casting the elemental magics of earth, water, air, and fire; and are the only class able to wield the highly powerful dark magic. They are also the least physically powerful class, and can use the smallest selection of weapons and armor."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:3
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:47
msgctxt "class"
msgid "In the promotional ritual which attunes a necromancer more fully to the dark arts, he or she is transformed into a Lich--a powerful form of undead. In exchange for their natural bodies, liches gain access to the highest level spells and magical abilities."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:4
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:6
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Clerics are adventuring, spell casting holy men. Before they leave the sanctity of their orders, clerics learn basic fighting skills and a smattering of useful healing spells. The cleric class is the one best at casting spirit, body and mind magic; and is the only class capable of using the extremely powerful light magic. They are fair fighters, but are limited to the lighter armors and can only melee with blunt weapons."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:5
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:8
msgctxt "class"
msgid "When clerics are promoted to Priest of the Sun status, their heightened piety allows them to wield the most powerful magics of spirit, body, mind, and light."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:6
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:18
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Knights are human men and women of arms. They specialize in martial skills, and can become proficient in all weapons and armor. They are only second to the troll class in terms of physical toughness. On the other hand, knights are incapable of learning any of the magical arts."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:7
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:21
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Champions are knights who have gained promotion through experience and the completion of knightly quests. Champions are able to grandmaster in plate, shield, and many weapon and other martial skills."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:8
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:40
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Trolls are the most physically tough of all the classes--not only do they start with and gain the most hit points per level, they are also the best at the regeneration skill. Though they can only gain grandmastery of blunt weapons, they can use all weapons. They are, however limited to the lighter armors (though they can grandmaster in leather), and cannot use magic."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:9
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:41
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Those Trolls that survive through many battles can be promoted to the rank of War Troll. Now allowed to reach grandmaster rank in regeneration and other martial skills, the War Troll can train to change from being a formidable opponent into something truly mighty."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:10
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:22
msgctxt "class"
msgid "The race of Minotaurs has descended from creatures created as magically attuned guardians. While primarily skilled in arts of war, Minotaurs are also able to use body, spirit and mind magic. They can use all weapons, but specialize in the axe and can wear all types of armor, though they cannot carry shields or wear helmets."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:11
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:23
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Only those Minotaurs who have exhibited extreme valor are promoted to the rank of Minotaur Lord. At this level, Minotaurs can gain grandmastery in the axe and perception skills."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:12
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:10
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Dark Elves are Elves who have chosen to follow the Path of Dark. All Dark Elves have special magical abilities exclusive to their race. Adventuring Dark Elves are capable fighters, particularly with the bow, and users of elemental magics. They also excel at the disarm traps and merchant skills."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:13
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:11
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Patriarch"
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:13
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:11
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Dark Elves who pass certain tests become members of the races higher order, achieving the rank of Patriarch. Patriarchs can become warrior mages of extreme power."
msgstr ""

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/class.txt.py:14
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Class.txt.py:42
