#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:53
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The black potion of Divine Boost temporarily increases all your Seven Statistics. To mix this potion, you require the correct combination of eleven reagents: of which there are always three blue and three yellow ones. The remaining five differ in the many possible mixes that lead to obtaining this potion."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:54
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The black potion of Divine Protection combines the effects of the white resistance boosting potions, temporarily increasing all your resistances. To mix this potion, you require the correct combination of twelve reagents: of which there are always three red and three yellow ones. The remaining six differ in the many possible mixes that lead to obtaining this potion."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:55
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The black potion of Divine Transcendence temporarily increases a character’s level. To mix this potion, you require the correct combination of ten reagents: three of each color plus an additional one of a random color."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:56
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Essence of Luck increases a character’s Luck by 15, while subtracting 2 from the other statistics. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:57
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The magnificent Potion of the Gods increases all seven statistics of a character by 20, once. There are many ways to mix this potion, but all involve ten reagents: four of one type and three of the other two types."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:58
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The Potion of Doom increases a character’s Seven Statistics, Life, Spell Points, Armor Class and Resistances by 1 at the cost of magically aging them 5 years. This potion can be mixed in more than one way, but always requires eight reagents: two of one type and three of the other two types."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:59
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Pure Fire Resistance increases your character’s Fire Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least three red, four yellow and two blue reagents."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:60
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Pure Air Resistance increases your character’s Air Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least four red, four blue and one yellow reagent."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:61
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Pure Water Resistance increases your character’s Water Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least two red, three yellow and four blue reagents."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:62
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Pure Earth Resistance increases your character’s Earth Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least four red, three yellow and two blue reagents."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:63
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Pure Body Resistance increases your character’s Body Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least two red, four yellow and three blue reagents."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:64
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Pure Mind Resistance increases your character’s Mind Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least three red, two yellow and four blue reagents."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:65
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Essence of Might increases a character’s Might by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Intellect. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:66
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Essence of Intellect increases a character’s Intellect by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Might. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:67
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Essence of Personality increases a character’s Personality by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Speed. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:68
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Essence of Accuracy increases a character’s Accuracy by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Endurance. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:69
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Essence of Endurance increases a character’s Endurance by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Accuracy. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:70
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Essence of Speed increases a character’s Speed by 15, while subtracting 5 from his Personality. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:71
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The Protection from Magic potion grants the drinker the effect of the spell for a duration dependent on potion strength. This potion requires seven reagents to mix: two of each type plus the seventh, which can be of any color. This means the potion can be obtained in three distinct ways."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:72
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid ""
"Hello, caravaneer.\n"
"\n"
"I have an offer for you, which would eclipse the career of any adventurer! Meet me in Murmurwoods, inside circle of stones. Won't trust more details to paper.\n"
"I will be there *any time* you will decide to come, but even it is against code of our organization, I plead, do not delay too long.\n"
"\n"
"V."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:73
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid ""
"Hello, nobles.\n"
"\n"
"I have an offer for you, which would eclipse the fate of any hero! Meet me in empty tower of Clancer's laborathory in Tularean forest. Won't trust more details to paper.\n"
"I will be there *any time* you will decide to come, but even it is against code of our organization, I plead, do not delay too long.\n"
"\n"
"V."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:74
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid ""
"Hello, adventurers.\n"
"\n"
"I have an offer for you, which would eclipse the fate of any hero! Meet me in Abdul's Resort in Dragonsand. Won't trust more details to paper.\n"
"I will be near pedestal there *any time* you will decide to come, but even it is against code of our organization, I plead, do not delay too long.\n"
"\n"
"V."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Scroll.txt.py:76
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid ""
"Fellow journeman!\n"
"\n"
"Noble Lord Markham organizes a grandiose match on the Emerald island!\n"
"Take your chance to enter the pantheon of the nobles, winning the right to rule the famous castle Harmondale and all it's neighborhoods!\n"
"\n"
"Boats from Steadwick shipping Emerald Island each wednesday, while contest is on the way.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

